OL,3,GNEWSAUK economy grew by 0.7% in third
OL,4,Aquarter, the fastest rate for two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK economy grew by 0.7% from July
OL,7,Fto September, the fastest rate for two
OL,8,Fyears
OL,10,FThe growth was "almost entirely due to
OL,11,Fstrong and widespread growth in the
OL,12,Fservices sector", says the chief
OL,13,Feconomist at the Office for National
OL,14,FStatistics
OL,16,FWithin the service sector, computer
OL,17,Fprogramming increased strongly, the ONS
OL,18,Fsays, as well as "AI-linked businesses"
